		(descr "3PDT latching footswitch (blue stomp switch), solder lugs. Lug grid 5.3 mm between poles x 4.7 mm between throws, plated slots 2.8 x 1.3 mm (PedalDivision 3PDT size) with 3.8 x 2.4 mm pads; the slots hold the switch square while soldering. Pole A = 1-3, B = 4-6, C = 7-9; 2/5/8 = commons. The switch body goes on the side this footprint is placed on.")
